{"files":[{"content":"#include <bits/stdc++.h>\n\nusing namespace std;\n\nint A[1000][1000];\nint ps[1010][1010];\n\ntypedef long long ll;\n\nll solve(int m, int n, int k) {\n  for (int i = 1; i <= m; i++) {\n    for (int j = 1; j <= n; j++) {\n      ps[i][j] = A[i - 1][j - 1] + ps[i][j - 1];\n    }\n  }\n\n  ll ans = 0;\n  const ll estimated_work = (ll)n * (n + 1) / 2 * m;\n  auto process_j = [&](int j, unordered_map<ll, ll>& h) {\n    ll subtotal = 0;\n    for (int l = j; l <= n; l++) {\n      h.clear();\n      h[0] = 1;\n      ll s = 0;\n      for (int i = 1; i <= m; i++) {\n        s += ps[i][l] - ps[i][j - 1];\n        auto it = h.find(s - k);\n        if (it != h.end()) subtotal += it->second;\n        h[s]++;\n      }\n    }\n    return subtotal;\n  };\n\n  if (estimated_work >= 65536) {\n#pragma omp parallel reduction(+ : ans)\n    {\n      unordered_map<ll, ll> h;\n#pragma omp for schedule(dynamic, 1)\n      for (int j = 1; j <= n; j++) {\n        ans += process_j(j, h);\n      }\n    }\n  } else {\n    unordered_map<ll, ll> h;\n    for (int j = 1; j <= n; j++) {\n      ans += process_j(j, h);\n    }\n  }\n  return ans;\n}\n\nint main() {\n  int k, m, n;\n  cin >> k >> m >> n;\n  memset(A, 0, sizeof A);\n  memset(ps, 0, sizeof ps);\n\n  for (int i = 0; i < m; i++)\n    for (int j = 0; j < n; j++)\n      cin >> A[i][j];\n\n  cout << solve(m, n, k) << endl;\n  return 0;\n}\n","path":"src/main.cpp"}],"hypothesis":"Dynamic OpenMP work sharing over independent column-start groups should use four cores more evenly than serial execution, while thread-local histograms and a reduction avoid contention. A work estimate keeps small cases serial to avoid parallel-region overhead.","notes":"The threshold is based on estimated row visits across all column pairs. Histogram state is private to each thread and reused across its assigned groups. No build configuration or other files are changed.","research":{"queries":[],"urls":[]},"sources_kept":[],"transformations":["Parallelize the independent column-start loop with OpenMP dynamic scheduling in chunks of one.","Accumulate per-group counts locally and combine them using an OpenMP reduction; keep each thread's histogram private.","Use a serial path when estimated pair-row work is below 65536."]}